<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Holy Paladin Healer</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-holy-paladin-healer">Head for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>There's only one 359 pre-raid option here, and it's the Engi goggles. They are BoP, so you must have the profession to craft them. While on first glance they look like they're missing stats, the Cogwheel "sockets" are actually the equivalent of the secondary stats that are essentially mix and match. Additionally, for some reason, they're slightly overitemized for a 359, meaning that they will be better than all other 359s.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
