<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-holy-paladin-healer">Wrist for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>This is the other slot in which there's no pre-raid 359 option, and in fact only two 346 options in total.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> (Leatherworking) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96262/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74237/enchant-bracer-exceptional-spirit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Exceptional Spirit</span></a> (budget) <b>+</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
