<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-holy-paladin-healer">Waist for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Two great 359 options here and they're both fairly easy to obtain! They're almost identical in stats, so it's generally recommended to pick up the rep one instead especially as it's itemized better and Blacksmith crafts tend to be fairly expensive.<div class="pad"></div>
