<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-holy-paladin-healer">Legs for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>In Phase 1 of Cataclysm, you must purchase the normal mode (359) version of the tier chest/<wbr/>gloves/<wbr/>legs, so this is one of those slots. Upgrading to the heroic (372) version will require the normal mode base item. Unfortunately, they're the only 359 preraid option in this slot and they're quite expensive.<br/>
<br/>It's worth noting that due to the missing sockets on the Spirit/<wbr/>Crit legs (as well as being meh stats), these are unique among other 346s that they're kind of underitemized (essentially 40ish less int). Avoid them if possible.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54450/powerful-ghostly-spellthread">
