<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Holy Paladin Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-holy-paladin-healer">Neck for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>There's an interesting dilemma here as the absolute BiS neck is a very rare world drop that will likely not be even remotely obtainable for the vast majority of players... but there's also another 359 neck available just from rep, though it is unfortunately a bit worse itemized as it has no spirit or haste. In general, you should just ignore the world drop one and get the rep one.<br/>
<br/>There is a very large amount of 346 jewelry available, but again, just remember that same ilvl gear is all roughly similar for us. As long as you have at least a 346 neck, you're good.<div class="pad"></div>
