<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-holy-paladin-healer">Rings for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Are ya ready to dig - again? We have three 359 options, two from Valor Points and one from... yup, Tol'vir Archaeology. It's important to emphasize that until you have 359s in the other slots and at least 346 everywhere else, it is not worth going out of your way to spend time with Tol'vir Archaeology for this ring - it's a very very minor increase as ring slots don't have that much stats to begin with.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
