<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-and-shields-for-holy-paladin-healer">Off Hands and Shields for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>The biggest change to off-hands in Cataclysm is that now, there is a dedicated offhand enchant that works on ALL off-hands, not just shields. This combined with the fact that off-hands and shields have the same stat values means that while we still do generally prefer shields due to the free armor and lower contest, we can now freely use non-shield offhands as well if that's what we have.<br/>
<br/>Be aware that there is some amount of unavoidable physical damage in Tier 11's raids, meaning that the armor from a shield is pretty valuable. For this reason, shields are generally recommended, but the off-hand options are presented for completion's sake.<br/>
<br/>There are two 359s available for this slot; a fairly expensive crafted shield, and a very expensive BoE world drop. The shield is better and will be much more available too, though again, it will definitely be quite expensive at least early in the expansion.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Off-Hand or Shield Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74235/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Off-Hand - Superior Intellect</span></a>
