<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-holy-paladin-healer">Relics for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Relics are very straightforward in Cataclysm, they are just stat sticks that are universal across Paladin/<wbr/>Druid/<wbr/>Shaman. Most of them throughout the expansion come from vendors, but the 346 preraid ones will come from dungeons. If you get extremely unlucky, you can also just craft the Inscription one.<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind for the Valor purchaseable relics, the overall stat gain is very low so despite the low price tag, you should generally hold off buying it for as long as possible.<div class="pad"></div>
